==Notes==
* The player can skip going back to the Military Detective, as they already have access to the Second Sea even without talking to him.
* [[Buddha#Moveset_(V2)|Awakened Buddha]] is one of the most efficient [[Blox Fruits|fruits]] for farming in the Second Sea, due to its fighting style or sword M1 range being highly increased and its damage reduction.

==Trivia==
* Second Sea contains the most [[Easter Eggs]] in the game.
* Players are introduced to the new currency [[Fragments]] in the second sea. 
* Players are also introduced to [[Titles]] in the second sea.  
* [[Raids]] are introduced to new players in the second sea (which allow awakening of fruits).
* [[Dungeons]] are introduced in the second sea
*Second Sea is the sea with most introductions to new things.
*Race V2 is introduced in Second Sea.
*Race V3 is introduced in Second Sea.

